--F_CHECKLIST
✅ Already Implemented:
 Login

 Key-based registration

 Secure key request flow

 Fetch user data (Mon, Souls)

 Shop + character listing

 Server-client communication validated and working

📋 Core Features You Still Need (For a Playable Game)
🧍‍♂️ Player Profile & Character Ownership
 "Buy character" from shop → store to player's owned list

 Database table for user’s owned characters

 Retrieve owned characters on login or team-select screen

 Equip/load characters into a team

🎮 Gameplay Mechanics (Turn-Based Combat)
 Team loadout UI and server validation

 Battle matchmaking or challenge system (1v1, AI, etc.)

 Battle instance creation (server-side room/session)

 Turn system (per-character turn bar, turn order, etc.)

 Skill execution & target resolution

 Hit/miss, critical, dodge, damage formulas

 Buff/debuff application

 Death, victory, surrender logic

 Reward distribution after match (e.g., Souls, XP)

🧠 State & Syncing
 Server-side validation of all combat actions

 Real-time or turn-based packet sync (queue, replayable log, etc.)

 Timeout/disconnect handling

 Anti-cheat logic (basic sanity checks)

📦 Inventory & Progression
 Character leveling system

 Equipment system (optional for now)    

 Item shop / rewards

 Save/load progression (XP, stats, etc.)

🛒 Shop & Monetization (Extended)
 Character purchase flow (costs Souls)

 Gacha or random draw system (if planned)

 Soft/hard currency distinction logic

🧪 Testing & Debug Features
 In-game log or packet inspector (dev builds only)

 Server admin tools (kick, force battle end, etc.)

 Unit test for skill logic (maybe in C++ test suite)

📡 Networking Glue
 Lobby system or room queue (matchmaking layer)

 Room teardown after game ends

 Turn timer & handling timeouts

 Spectator or replay support (optional)

🧾 Account Features
 Change password (optional)

 Player profile (maybe just a name and avatar)

 Daily rewards, quests, or login streaks (optional)

🖼️ Polish & UX (client side mostly)
 Error messages for failed requests (e.g., shop fail, team invalid)

 Loading indicators for async requests

 Transitions and animations (not critical, but improves flow)

 Sound effects for interactions

⚙️ DevOps / Hosting Checklist (for live testing)
 Auto-restart on crash (systemd or supervisor)

 Log rotation (if logs are written)

 Server metric tracking (CPU, sessions)

 Simple monitoring or alert system (for downtime)